    ],
    "text": "Issued at 05.30 a.m. on 17 September 2026. Showers will occur at times in the Western, Sabaragamuwa and Southern provinces. Fairly heavy falls above 50 mm are likely at some places in Galle, Matara, Kalutara and Rathnapura districts.",
